        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Core Bundle gives you a single robotic platform that handles your lawn, your driveway, and your leaves — all season long. One base unit. Three swappable modules. Zero boundary wires.</p><p>Swap the Lawn Mower Pro module in spring and summer. Lock in the Snow Blower module when winter hits. Keep the leaf blower ready for fall. Module changes take minutes, not tools.</p><p><strong>What you get in this bundle:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Yarbo Core</strong> — The all-terrain tracked base with RTK GPS navigation and AI obstacle avoidance</li><li><strong>Lawn Mower Pro Module</strong> — Precision mowing up to 6 acres, programmable cut height, and edge detection</li><li><strong>Snow Blower Module</strong> — Clears driveways and paths automatically, handles up to 12 inches of snow</li></ul><p>Controlled entirely from the Yarbo app on iOS or Android. Map your property once. Let it run on your schedule.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>One machine. Every season. Zero compromise.</strong></p><p>The Yarbo Core is the tracked, all-terrain base that powers the entire Yarbo system. It navigates using RTK GPS, binocular vision, and multi-sensor fusion, mapping your property to centimeter-level accuracy without a single boundary wire in the ground.</p><h3>Yarbo Core</h3><ul><li>RTK GPS + Vision + IMU navigation for centimeter-accurate mapping</li><li>Handles slopes up to 70% (35°), far beyond any wheeled robot</li><li>Tracked drive system built for mud, snow, and uneven terrain</li><li>Tows up to 500 lbs daily / 3,500 lbs max rolling weight</li><li>Connects via 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and Wi-Fi HaLow</li><li>Quiet operation, designed for residential and commercial properties</li></ul><h3>Lawn Mower Pro Module</h3><ul><li>Precision cutting with programmable height adjustment</li><li>Edge detection for clean perimeter passes</li><li>Covers approximately 0.25 acres per charge (based on Yarbo's recommended 80% to 20% battery usage window)</li><li>Attaches and detaches from the Core in minutes</li></ul><h3>Snow Blower Module</h3><ul><li>Automatically clears driveways, paths, and open areas</li><li>Handles up to 12 inches of snow depth</li><li>Adjustable throw direction via the Yarbo app</li><li>Rated for operation down to approximately -13°F (confirm on Yarbo's current spec sheet before publishing)</li></ul><p><strong>All modules are controlled from one app.</strong> Set schedules, define zones, and monitor progress from anywhere.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>2-Year Manufacturer Warranty</strong> </p><p> Every Yarbo Core and module in this bundle is covered by Yarbo's manufacturer warranty: 2 years on parts and labor for defective components (excluding consumables), from the date you activate your machine.</p><p><strong>Manufacturer-Backed Return Policy</strong> </p><p> Returns follow each manufacturer's own return policy, which varies by product. Details are provided before purchase and included with your order confirmation.</p><p><strong>Direct Email Support</strong> </p><p> Reach our team anytime at <a href=\"mailto:support@yardautomationpros.com\">support@yardautomationpros.com</a>. We reply within 1 business day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>From unboxing to autonomous operation in under 90 minutes.</strong></p><p>No trenches. No boundary wires. No professional installer needed. The Yarbo app walks you through every step.</p><ol><li><strong>Download the Yarbo app</strong> - Available on iOS and Android</li><li><strong>Power on the Core</strong> - RTK GPS signal locks within minutes</li><li><strong>Map your property</strong> - Walk the boundary once with the app or use satellite view to define zones</li><li><strong>Attach your module</strong> - Snap in the Lawn Mower Pro or Snow Blower module in minutes, no tools required</li><li><strong>Set your schedule</strong> - Choose days, times, and zones. The Yarbo handles the rest</li></ol><p>A full video setup guide is included in the box and available on our website. Our support team is also available to walk you through setup if needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Yarbo Core</strong></p><ul><li>Navigation: RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM</li><li>Max slope: 70% (35 degrees)</li><li>Towing capacity: 500 lbs daily / 3,500 lbs max rolling weight</li><li>Connectivity: 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow</li><li>Warranty: 2 years standard, extendable to 5 years</li><li>Estimated delivery: 10 to 14 business days</li></ul><p><strong>Lawn Mower Pro Module</strong></p><ul><li>Cutting area: [X acres per charge]</li><li>Cut height: [X mm to X mm], adjustable</li><li>Edge detection: Yes</li><li>Compatible base: Yarbo Core only</li></ul><p><strong>Snow Blower Module</strong></p><ul><li>Max snow depth: [X inches]</li><li>Throw distance: [X feet]</li><li>Operating temp: Down to [X°F]</li><li>Throw direction: App-controlled</li><li>Compatible base: Yarbo Core only</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_mkEKLQ": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "manuals",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Manuals & Downloads",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>All documentation for this bundle will be available here. Replace the links below with your actual file URLs once uploaded.</p><ul><li><a href=\"#\">Yarbo Core - Quick Start Guide (PDF)</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Yarbo Core - Full User Manual (PDF)</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Lawn Mower Pro Module - Setup Guide (PDF)</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Snow Blower Module - Setup Guide (PDF)</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Yarbo App - Getting Started Guide (PDF)</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Warranty Registration Form</a></li></ul><p>For video guides, visit our <a href=\"/pages/support\">Support page</a> or the <a href=\"https://www.yarbo.com\" target=\"_blank\">Yarbo official site</a>.</p>"
